-- Version 1.3 - movement, no fall damage and roof-index teleports
-- Game: [QUESTS] RoofLine [ALPHA] | place 101491736266699
-- Window toggle: RightControl | Panic: End | API: getgenv().RobScriptRoofLine
--
-- Everything here is client side. Walk speed and jump power are plain humanoid property
-- writes, infinite jump just re-requests the jump, and fly is a LinearVelocity on the
-- character, which the client owns. No game remote is involved, so the server never sees
-- a value to reject. The game's stamina controller rewrites WalkSpeed every frame, so the
-- override is written every frame from RenderStepped as well - a connection made last
-- runs last and wins the race.
--
-- Fall damage is prevented by capping the downward speed while airborne: the server reads
-- the replicated impact speed, and a landing below the threshold deals no damage and no
-- injuries. The no-shake camera experiment was dropped - intercepting the game's camera
-- writes also removed its first-person positioning, so it is not shipped here.

